    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "modeline.rs is a private module of document.rs. Its one test module is mod tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Change only push_label_char. When the scalar is U+2011, push an ASCII hyphen and return true. Do not push the U+2011 scalar itself. Do not replace an em dash. Do not nest an if inside an if.  Do not write two if arms that return the same value. Combine them with ||. That is clippy::if_same_then_else. Do not touch trailing_policy or kate_bool. The existing test unknown_encoding_label_is_ignored stays green. Do not rewrite its assertions. The test a_non_breaking_hyphen_selects_utf8 uses sample_file, modeline_overrides of kate: encoding utf, U+2011, 8, and apply_mode. The file encoding name is UTF-8. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines. Stay inside this one behavior. Run the full test module named in the commands, not only the new test."
  },
